  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the text implicitly suggest that thoughtful gift-giving is primarily about meeting genuine needs and demonstrating care, rather than just material exchange?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the importance of role models like Andrew Carnegie in promoting societal well-being, education, and the values of generosity and public service.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('0666bfa0-c168-478d-a513-e9cbff9e8a43', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$On Christmas Eve, the entire town was filled with excitement and joy. Preparations were in full swing. Joy, a five-year-old boy, was the happiest among them. He lived with his old grandfather, Joseph. Joy had been orphaned as a baby and raised by Joseph ever since. Joy had seen his grandfather work in the fields and how he had always found ways to bring happiness and wisdom to his grandson’s life. Each day after returning from the fields, despite his fatigue, he spends time with Joy, teaching him about kindness, patience and love. Joy noticed how hard his Grandpa worked and how little he complained. This year's winter was harsher and it rained occasionally. Joy saw how Joseph would come home shivering, his coat drenched with rain.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('22fcd47d-8cb6-486b-a55d-dd9f7560fb26', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy had seen his grandfather work in the fields and how he had always found ways to bring happiness and wisdom to his grandson’s life. Each day after returning from the fields, despite his fatigue, he spends time with Joy, teaching him about kindness, patience and love. Joy noticed how hard his Grandpa worked and how little he complained. This year's winter was harsher and it rained occasionally. Joy saw how Joseph would come home shivering, his coat drenched with rain.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('3f0c6184-fc3d-4e30-a1c4-c36e4309ce05', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$After the lesson, I will be able to: read the text with correct pronunciation, intonation and expressions explore and appreciate the theme learn new words and use them in sentences answer questions based on the story use sentences and their kinds correctly write a dialogue$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('ca0f2350-e3b3-41b7-8cd5-f98d938f5ab2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$You just received a surprise birthday present from your friends.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('e1a7e856-59dd-47c4-a651-8a58e551254b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$You forgot your lines during the school play and everyone was watching.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('8151966c-e07a-4e0b-aba2-0656d9b0014a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy stood by; he had very little money and could not afford to spend a significant part of it on just one ride. Some of Joy’s friends rushed to the row of toy shops. The toys were too expensive for Joy. “They are only toys. What use are they? You will play with them for a few days and after that, they will just lie in your room,” he told his friends. “One fall and they’ll break!” Though he said this, he couldn’t help but look at the toys with a hint of envy. As his friends moved on to the shops selling sweets, chocolates and ice cream, Joy watched. He bought nothing. His funds were too limited for such luxuries, yet he couldn’t help but eye the sweets and ice cream in his friends’ hands.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('6128cd92-476a-47f9-8144-92946332a357', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$“You look pretty sad, little one,” said Santa. Joy looked at him and said, “I don’t know what to buy! I'm confused.” Santa smiled and said, “Well, | can help you . English-8 with this. Who do you love the most?” “My Grandpa.” “Well,” said Santa, “Now you know for whom you want to buy the gift. Let’s go further. What would your Grandpa love to get as a present?” “Let me think... Grandpa often feels cold at night when he sleeps after a hard day’s work in the fields. | think the best gift would be a warm blanket. Yes! A warm blanket, it will be! Thank you, Santa, thank you.” Joy jumped with happiness and kissed Santa on his cheek. Santa was amused. He blessed Joy and walked away.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('02cdc376-2f34-47d6-a8ef-28c586e175f9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Seeing this, Joy decided that he would gift his Grandpa something special this Christmas. Though unsure what to give, he knew he would find it at the Christmas market. So, off he went to the Christmas market with his friends. Rows upon rows of stalls and festive decorations greeted them as they arrived at the market, stretching well beyond the main square. Children darted towards the toy shops and sweet stalls. Rides were set up, with swings and roundabouts spinning joyfully, each ride costing a small sum.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('6e322969-75ab-478f-8583-d10cb9997860', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Soon, Joy passed by some shops selling warm clothes, which held no interest for the boys. However, Joy stopped before a shop selling blankets. There, on an old wooden table, lay a warm, cosy blue blanket. Thinking of his Grandpa, who often felt cold at night after spending hours in the fields, Joy knew how perfect this blanket would be for him. Hesitatingly, Joy asked the shopkeeper the price of the blanket. The shopkeeper quoted a price that was too high for Joy.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('ed4dfbd7-8e2a-4878-8e2e-7a99b9d4b7e5', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy stood by; he had very little money and could not afford to spend a significant part of it on just one ride. Some of Joy’s friends rushed to the row of toy shops. The toys were too expensive for Joy. “They are only toys. What use are they? You will play with them for a few days and after that, they will just lie in your room,” he told his friends. “One fall and they’ll break!” Though he said this, he couldn’t help but look at the toys with a hint of envy. As his friends moved on to the shops selling sweets, chocolates and ice cream, Joy watched. He bought nothing. His funds were too limited for such luxuries, yet he couldn’t help but eye the sweets and ice cream in his friends’ hands. Why does Joy not spend his money on sweets, chocolates and other desserts? Just then, Joy saw Santa all dressed in red. Santa laughed aloud, “Ho, ho, ho!” He looked at Joy, winked at him and called him to his side. “You look pretty sad, little one,” said Santa. Joy looked at him and said, “I don’t know what to buy! I'm confused.”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('d1f9c1cc-7ab4-4c9a-9734-6f0286c8fe1f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy hesitatingly offered almost half the price the shopkeeper had quoted and, without waiting for the reply, walked away, fearing ridicule. To his surprise, the shopkeeper called him back and agreed to sell it at a discounted price. Elated, Joy caught up with his friends and showed off the blanket. Allen laughed, “What will you do with this?”$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('d1f93c94-a6a3-400f-847a-be26871d390f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Later that evening, back at home, Joy and his Grandpa shared the warmth of the new blanket as they talked about the day’s adventures. Joseph listened with pride and a hint of sadness, knowing the sacrifices Joy had made to buy this thoughtful gift. As the night deepened and the cold grew more biting, they drifted off to sleep under the cosy blanket.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('d0642b76-635f-468d-aadc-d9a545712e1b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The next morning, Joy woke up to an unusual warmth. Surprised, he found an extra layer of blanket covering him. He looked over at his grandfather, who was already awake, sipping his morning tea. “Grandpa, who put this extra blanket on me?” Joy asked curiously, his eyes wide with wonder. Joseph smiled; a twinkle in his eye was reminiscent of the Santa who had spoken to Joy the day before. “It must have been Santa, Joy. Only Santa would know how much you cared to keep me warm and decided you deserved the same,” he said gently.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('31b1bc43-c8b0-429d-8be4-84553c978d30', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy’s heart swelled with happiness and he hugged his Grandpa tightly. “Thank you, Santa,” he whispered, believing in the magic of Christmas more than ever. Joseph hugged him back, both grateful and moved by the boy’s kindness and maturity. “Merry Christmas, Joy. You've made this one of the best Christmas ever, not just for me, but for yourself as well. You've learnt the joy English-8 @$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 5, NULL),
  ('0372b816-0297-4f7e-9a9e-68c085c248f0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy later encountered a friend struggling to afford a small gift for their own grandparent. Joy remembered his own experience with the blanket.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('e0976b68-e677-4977-b777-f83db01cc5a3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Years later, Joy, now an adult, found himself in a position to help a young person who was making a significant personal sacrifice for a loved one.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('a453b0d8-6cf0-4e8d-897e-8eb62c37531e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Imagine Joy's Grandpa, Joseph, reflecting on this particular Christmas a year later.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('8a4f374a-3667-4918-bdca-8adc42cb93b1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A local newspaper reporter heard about Joy's story and wanted to write an article titled 'The True Spirit of Christmas.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('1dee5d97-e20e-42d2-b2d7-9e2efbbacb6d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy's friend Allen, who initially laughed at the blanket, later witnessed the warmth and happiness it brought to Joy and his Grandpa.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
  ('71c0fcb8-8fa0-4029-a648-c17725737c06', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Joy, a young boy, observed that his grandfather often felt cold at night. Driven by a desire to provide comfort, Joy decided to purchase a warm blanket as a Christmas gift. This thoughtful and practical choice brought immense warmth, not just physically but emotionally, to their small, warm home. The simple act of caring completed a full circle, enveloping them in the true spirit of the season.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f2d459ee-64ce-4710-b62d-56b58e037280', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Andrew Carnegie, a renowned philanthropist, dedicated nearly 90% of his vast fortune to public good, primarily funding libraries, education, and scientific advancements. His efforts led to the establishment of over 2,500 libraries globally, significantly impacting access to knowledge and learning for countless individuals. His legacy underscores the profound societal benefits of strategic generosity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('1f2dbce2-e255-4a17-ac29-12b42535c77c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The concept of 'Kindness costs nothing' is a fundamental principle in fostering positive human interactions. This idea encourages individuals to perform simple acts of empathy and support, recognizing that such gestures can significantly brighten someone's day. Integrating this principle into competency-based learning, often facilitated by interactive tools like smart board software, helps students understand and practice its profound value.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('5426f19a-3e29-4ca1-8262-14985090395d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The NEP Guidelines emphasize a holistic approach to education, encouraging not just rote learning but also analytical thinking and practical application. Exercises designed under these guidelines often prompt students to reflect on values, understand complex relationships (like assertion and reasoning), and engage with vocabulary in meaningful contexts. This approach aims to develop well-rounded individuals capable of critical thought and empathetic action.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('03127c21-6c7d-42b6-98f8-8de730ca76e2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story highlights a small, warm home on Christmas morning where the 'season's true spirit enveloped them, more tangible and cosier than any blanket could ever be.' This description emphasizes the emotional warmth derived from an act of caring.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('802e10c0-89ad-4c4a-a399-7eb9929ee2e6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text presents a list of words for oral reading: hesitatingly, ridicule, reminiscent, enveloped, fatigue. These words, while seemingly disparate, can be explored for their emotional or situational relevance.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('8cd114b4-429b-4224-aecb-e85985b43f04', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text includes an assertion: 'Joy chose the gift for his grandfather because his grandfather often felt cold at night.' The reasoning is: 'Joy knew his grandfather needed warmth, making it a thoughtful and practical choice.'$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('fe369b19-6b9d-41c8-8b48-e6639ab99224', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story begins with the idea 'of giving and now you've received a little magic yourself.' This suggests a reciprocal benefit to acts of generosity, implying that the giver also gains something intangible.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('150d2361-c54a-4ded-a262-3db09ad426f8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The 'TIME FOR DISCUSSION' prompt is 'Be the sunshine that brightens someone’s day.' This is an active call to action for individuals to make a positive personal impact.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('f8ac3d09-2f82-410e-a9c6-4810a968b05e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The text asks, 'What do we learn about the value of gifts from Joy’s decision to buy a warm blanket for his grandfather?' (Analysing). This question prompts deeper reflection beyond the material aspect of gift-giving.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
  ('72c72fe8-b5ff-4bd7-994d-46d8753416e8', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '684fc31b-012f-4f53-b7ae-e5aa863b3450', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story emphasizes that the 'simple act of caring had come full circle' in Joy's home. This phrase signifies a complete cycle of positive interaction and reciprocal benefit.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 3, NULL),
