 Grandpa love to get as a present?” “Let me think... Grandpa often feels cold at night when he sleeps after a hard day’s work in the fields. | think the best gift would be a warm blanket. Yes! A warm blanket, it will be! Thank you, Santa, thank you.” Joy jumped with happiness and kissed Santa on his cheek. Santa was amused. He blessed Joy and walked away. Soon, Joy passed by some shops selling warm clothes, which held no interest for the boys. However, Joy stopped before a shop selling blankets. There, on an old wooden table, lay a warm, cosy blue blanket. Thinking of his Grandpa, who often felt cold at night after spending hours in the fields, Joy knew how perfect this blanket would be for him. Hesitatingly, Joy asked the shopkeeper the price of the blanket. The shopkeeper quoted a price that was too high for Joy. With his$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-30T06-17-51-467Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 25, NULL),
